      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 6.239,
          "en": "-: So time to make our items editable by clicking them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 6.239,
          "end": 10.53,
          "en": "In our shopping list component where we have our items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 10.53,
          "end": 12.42,
          "en": "I want to add a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.42,
          "end": 15.93,
          "en": "to the item so that we, well can click it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.93,
          "end": 19.14,
          "en": "Here, I want to call on added item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.14,
          "end": 23.58,
          "en": "Of course, any name you like? Simply copy it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 23.58,
          "end": 25.89,
          "en": "Now here though, I also want to get the idea",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 25.89,
          "end": 28.08,
          "en": "of the ingredient and I need the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.08,
          "end": 30.72,
          "en": "so that I'm later able to replace the correct one",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.72,
          "end": 34.56,
          "en": "in the array of ingredients, which is managed in a service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 34.56,
          "end": 36.06,
          "en": "So let's extract the ID",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.06,
          "end": 38.79,
          "en": "like this 'I equals index'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.79,
          "end": 42.12,
          "en": "to get the well index of the current iteration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.12,
          "end": 44.97,
          "en": "and let's pass it here as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.97,
          "end": 48.84,
          "en": "Now I can copy this name and go into my TypeScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.84,
          "end": 52.74,
          "en": "Here, I want to add on added item and I know",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.74,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "that I will get the index here, which will be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 57.18,
          "en": "And now there are a couple",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.18,
          "end": 59.28,
          "en": "of ways of getting this information,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.28,
          "end": 62.73,
          "en": "this index to this shopping added component, which is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 62.73,
          "end": 64.2,
          "en": "in the end where I want to get it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.2,
          "end": 67.35,
          "en": "to because that is where we are editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.35,
          "end": 70.71000000000001,
          "en": "I will use the service or specifically a subject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 70.71000000000001,
          "end": 72.63,
          "en": "in that service to which I can listen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.63,
          "end": 74.91,
          "en": "in the shopping added component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.91,
          "end": 76.09700000000001,
          "en": "So I will add a new subject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.09700000000001,
          "end": 78.6,
          "en": "in the shopping list service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.6,
          "end": 81.24,
          "en": "and that'll name 'started editing'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.24,
          "end": 83.01,
          "en": "Sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.01,
          "end": 87.088,
          "en": "It'll be a new subject, and subject is a generic type.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.088,
          "end": 89.73,
          "en": "It will hold a number in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.73,
          "end": 92.07,
          "en": "That's all I need to change here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 96.47999999999999,
          "en": "With this subject created in on added item, I can reach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.47999999999999,
          "end": 100.17,
          "en": "out to the shopping list service, which we already inject",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.17,
          "end": 102.72,
          "en": "and then use 'started editing' and emit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.72,
          "end": 107.58,
          "en": "a new value, my 'index' which will make sure that now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.58,
          "end": 110.43,
          "en": "we pass on this index",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 110.43,
          "end": 112.86,
          "en": "to our subject for now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.86,
          "end": 116.28,
          "en": "so that we can listen to it in some other place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.28,
          "end": 118.89,
          "en": "That our place is going to be in the shopping",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.89,
          "end": 122.07,
          "en": "added component here in 'N G On In It'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 124.893,
          "en": "This sounds like a good place to do the listening.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.85,
          "end": 128.64,
          "en": "I'm already injecting the shopping list service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.64,
          "end": 133.64,
          "en": "So here I will subscribe to my started editing subject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 134.16,
          "end": 136.26,
          "en": "And of course I should clean up the subscription",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.26,
          "end": 138.27,
          "en": "if we destroy this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 138.27,
          "end": 140.07999999999998,
          "en": "So I will store it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 140.94,
          "end": 143.34,
          "en": "in a property named 'subscription'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 143.34,
          "end": 146.4,
          "en": "which is of type subscription, which I should import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 146.4,
          "end": 149.79,
          "en": "from 'RX JS subscription'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.79,
          "end": 153.18,
          "en": "And I'll move up both these imports here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.18,
          "end": 154.623,
          "en": "to the top of the file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 158.85,
          "en": "So with that, we got our subscription property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 158.85,
          "end": 161.573,
          "en": "As I just said, I want to store my subscription",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.573,
          "end": 166.23,
          "en": "in this property and now I will implement 'On Destroy'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 166.23,
          "end": 168.41,
          "en": "Therefore, you should import this interface from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.41,
          "end": 172.98,
          "en": "'@ Angular core' and then also implement 'N G On Destroy'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 172.98,
          "end": 176.13,
          "en": "to clean up the subscription, just to be sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.13,
          "end": 178.38,
          "en": "that you don't create a memory leak.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 178.38,
          "end": 179.57999999999998,
          "en": "So that's to clean up work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 179.57999999999998,
          "end": 182.43,
          "en": "But what should happen inside of this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 182.43,
          "end": 186.21,
          "en": "Well, here we know that we will receive the number of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.21,
          "end": 190.68,
          "en": "the item we're about to edit, and this will be triggered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 190.68,
          "end": 195.45,
          "en": "whenever we submit the well 'started editing' information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 195.45,
          "end": 197.73,
          "en": "We also know something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 197.73,
          "end": 201.3,
          "en": "We only get here into this anonymous function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "if 'started editing' was triggered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 206.34,
          "en": "So if we are editing, so that is an important",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 206.34,
          "end": 208.68,
          "en": "information when it comes to what we should do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.68,
          "end": 210.15,
          "en": "once the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 210.15,
          "end": 213.45,
          "en": "Should we create a new item or edit an existing one?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.45,
          "end": 217.26,
          "en": "So I want to store the mode we're in here in a property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 217.26,
          "end": 220.8,
          "en": "I'll name it 'edit mode' and by default, it's false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 220.8,
          "end": 224.28,
          "en": "Here, however I will set 'edit mode' to true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.28,
          "end": 226.383,
          "en": "because we are editing, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 227.28,
          "end": 230.94,
          "en": "So, with this we now get the index and we are editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 230.94,
          "end": 235.07999999999998,
          "en": "I also want to store the index of the item we're editing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 235.07999999999998,
          "end": 239.49,
          "en": "So 'edited item index' could be a property name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.49,
          "end": 240.39,
          "en": "It will be a number",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 240.39,
          "end": 243.84,
          "en": "in the end and it will get initialized here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.84,
          "end": 248.07,
          "en": "'Edited item index' will be the index we're getting here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.07,
          "end": 249.063,
          "en": "as an argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.005,
          "end": 254.4,
          "en": "So with that, we got a lot of important information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 254.4,
          "end": 257.04,
          "en": "Now with that information, I want to load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.04,
          "end": 259.26,
          "en": "the item we're about to edit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.26,
          "end": 262.623,
          "en": "So that is something I'll do in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
